132"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QPSKxEMuNSEQ7kNvwHXE5EG&_nc_oc=AdmPuhQ9rUR4HEGVDw8CgDkBK6fbcTbdAdRhLo8gr9FQMJjeAqBsPwcx3axx-cIRf3o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz-dslMom3Ag1oJitCpJCkj0ujU1jRf44S0hXn6S9ESIg&oe=69B00E57"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fw7LBuyeqCYQ7kNvwHlO92U&_nc_oc=Admc_yAfwcLiC2VUSBBOLn-DrEtRPRf0e1J9W0zUKrcwmDs4RN8ksUwnEADgrNQx-7w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx31kUUtvWKINxSub39PgY2jBIjxEzPyKyTLjxRxQF5mQ&oe=69B01395"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qdRcKNPjaUEQ7kNvwHrjuZ5&_nc_oc=AdnywSKDpcdp2PaEkhk3UqE47JZFlZUhxJ-IKjnKGg2ZTHK8zHKtnLK1gEOvu4_tFtM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzr0t5AD-RVSDXk3voYpGv1EGmcVRw5VHkIeSCz2_Zlmg&oe=69B02742"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JZr1RkAQ2k0Q7kNvwHFhp_A&_nc_oc=AdmkJpDoAIa6yTiutwV41_F4vxUfb_gqtm_AK-Q38_wQ4cX95htYfOgA5nimHu5M9Rs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwvFkuSIYFUt3ZHonztE91ODAHM0C1fMppiD3pLYd2VbA&oe=69B00DC4"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BMw5cL4tjFEQ7kNvwEZVGbg&_nc_oc=AdlG2lufNMVJ0EGocR7YT7eQE9uMBBNylyDzwDFt2SLUqCwVqxy7t_MF8Bm9yWFfBRA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx-2gcFY7cW0yhDUH3WCL4o7frxVbu-yDAinvRaPZUkIw&oe=69B00622"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": 